applesmc: Mac Pro 6,1 port lights as LED class devices.
The SMC drives the 20 LEDs behind the I/O panel ("Lightshow") and lights them for 15 s on motion. Keys from the
SMC firmware 2.20f18 (results/kernel/port-lights-20261018): LIT! manual mode, LInD per-LED level, LIEN motion
lighting, LIHD hold time, LIGO light up. Adds smc::<port> LEDs and port_lights, port_lights_motion,
port_lights_hold_ms and port_lights_show on the applesmc device.

